WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.360
Calls and meetings need a description. A blank entry is rejected; employee task editing is disabled.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:13.720
Save a meaningful meeting description with the outcome and next step, not a generic filler.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:21.000
Only the senior can propose a task revision, with a mandatory reason. The original stays unchanged.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.240
A separate checker confirms the revision. Before-and-after values remain in the history.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:32.560
Processed instructions stay locked even for a senior. A separate correction process is needed.
